vent`, `Impact`; bez `Actual`) a `NewsProvider.released_until(ts) -> list[Release]` (vydání s `DateTime ≤ ts`, včetně `surprise_z`, `surprise_missing`).","new_string":"**Rozhraní** (10.2): `NewsProvider.scheduled_between(ts_from, ts_to) -> list[ScheduledEvent]` (`id`, `DateTime`, `Currency`, `Event`, `Impact`; bez `Actual`; události s `ts_from ≤ DateTime < ts_to`, seřazené podle `DateTime`, pak `id`) a `NewsProvider.released_until(ts) -> list[Release]` (vydání s `DateTime ≤ ts`: pole `ScheduledEvent` plus `Actual`, `Forecast`, `Unit`, `surprise_z`, `surprise_missing`; stejné řazení)."}}}
